   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Frame from the sheet, edit model\nDraws the accepted front view in a rig pose. An experiment beside `frame-multipass`, not a replacement: it takes minutes per frame, and pose accuracy is judged against the rig.\n\nSame template difference as `model-sheet`: `FluxKontextMultiReferenceLatentMethod` is refused."
